"""Hand-written test set for product extraction (IT/EN/FR/DE/ES), realistic Vinted-style listings.

Each case: id, kind ("item": full page, with Vinted breadcrumb/size/colour/material structured fields;
"card": search card, only title + brand + size + condition), the inputs and `t`, the ground truth.

Truth keys (absent = not scored):
  brand   : catalog slug the system SHOULD return, or None when no catalog brand applies (brand outside the
            34-brand taxonomy, unbranded, replica without a real brand claim)
  model   : catalog line name, or None when no catalog line applies (any non-None answer is then a false positive)
  cat     : set of acceptable category slugs, or None when the taxonomy has no category for the item
  gender  : 'men'|'women'|'kids'|'unisex'|None (None: not derivable from the input)
  size    : canonical size token, or None
  color, material : canonical vocabulary token, or None
  susp    : True/False  whether suspicious (replica/fake) terms are legitimately present in the text
  defect  : True/False  whether the text really declares a defect
  bundle  : True when the listing sells several pieces
  team    : football team expected (or None)
  note    : why the case exists
"""

